@startuml LearningTutorRAGFlow
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant UI
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Backend (Monolith)" as BE
participant "AI Service" as AIS
participant "Orchestrator Agent" as ORCH
participant "Tutor Agent" as TUTOR
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
collections "Vector DB" as VDB
collections "Cache" as CACHE
queue "Queue" as Q
participant "Ingestion Worker" as IW

Teacher -> UI: Upload material
UI -> APIGW: /documents/upload
APIGW -> BE: store metadata
BE -> PG: save document metadata
BE -> Q: enqueue ingest (async)
Q -> IW: chunk + embed + index
IW -> VDB: upsert vectors
IW -> PG: update status=ready

Student -> UI: Ask question/text/image + language
UI -> APIGW: /chat/message
APIGW -> BE: request
BE -> AIS: tutoring request
AIS -> ORCH: intent=tutor_rag
ORCH -> TUTOR: answer with citations
TUTOR -> VDB: semantic retrieve top-k
TUTOR -> CACHE: optional cache lookup/update
TUTOR --> ORCH: explanation + misconception check + follow-up + citations
ORCH --> AIS: final answer
AIS --> BE: response
BE -> PG: save chat history
BE --> UI: answer + citations
@enduml
